    "ssky_text_block_TJmTzi": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_b3byJW": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h2>Open Your Mind with Tuttle Twins Books for Teens</h2>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "center",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "text_XBeMcT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Our teen book collection includes captivating stories that nurture your child’s young mind with thought-provoking ideas that help shape their futures. These books for teens spark curiosity, challenge conventional thinking, and encourage teens to develop a deeper understanding of personal freedom, responsibility, and the power of knowledge.</p><p>The best thing about our books is that any teen can enjoy them, from avid readers interested in <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-guide-to-modern-villains\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">modern villains</span></a> to those who are just beginning to explore books beyond their textbooks. </p><p>The books in this collection promote intellectual growth while being accessible and engaging, helping teens navigate the complexities of the world with confidence. As part of our mission to teach kids to be free, these books serve as an invaluable resource in raising empowered, informed, and independent individuals.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_b3byJW",
        "text_XBeMcT"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.ssky_text_block.name",
      "settings": {
